  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U4 Global Knowledge Hub on Anti-Corruption</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The U4 Partnership project will continue to provide a powerful collective voice on anti-corruption, specialised research, policy advice and outreach on anti-corruption and reducing its negative effects. The U4/TI Helpdesk online training for partners and accessible archive of work across many themes will remain the port of call for anti-corruption actors worldwide seeking high-quality information.</narrative>
  </description>
